<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea Kyongnam Bank reports loan fraud.</title>
<headline>S.Korea Kyongnam Bank reports loan fraud.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-10-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Kyongnam Bank said in a statement on Saturday that documents submitted by 14 firms to which it had extended 10.7 billion won in loans had proved to be fraudulent.</p>
<p>The loans were extended between February 15 and September 10.</p>
<p>The bank, based in the southeastern city of Masan, estimated the incident would translate into a loss of 5.3 billion won for the bank in the current fiscal year ending in December and 3.4 billion won next year.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5646</p>
</text>
